      ],
      "message": "test: remove dead multisig code from wallet_address_types\n\nThe send loop runs over do_multisigs = [False], so multisig is always\nfalse. True was only added for legacy wallets (59d3da5bce), and that\nwas removed together with the legacy wallet tests in c847dee148.\n\nRemove the multisig loop dimension, the unreachable multisig code path,\nwhich has not set the address it then checks since fe838dd391, and the\nmultisig cases of test_address and test_desc. Also drop the docstring\nsection about the removed addmultisigaddress tests, correct the senders\nto node0-node3, and fix the \"N/101th\" fractions in the same list.",
